message: "If you use, reference, or build on BlazePhoenix, please cite it with attribution and a link."
title: "BlazePhoenix Protocol — on-chain DEX aggregator and provably-solvent staking"
abstract: >-
  BlazePhoenix is an invariant-driven, on-chain DEX aggregator and single-asset
  staking protocol on Base, Ethereum, Optimism and Arbitrum. Quotes are computed
  on-chain by the Quoter contract; staking solvency is a per-transaction
  invariant that makes an insolvent state unreachable. Original constructions:
  the Iron Law Φ (on-chain re-derived output floor), the Vitality Field Ψ
  (keeper-free pool fitness), the Capital-Anchored Filter (capital-weighted
  manipulation resistance), and the Master Conservation Identity.
type: software
